# Scenario 'browser_pages': ホームページ (browser) against the richer synthetic site of traces/web (web=all): page-list tutorial (8 pages), connect,
# index.html, a.html (ol/ul/pre/div/img/comment/meta, image request img_a.bmp, LEFT/RIGHT between two links on one line), b.html (24 lines: scrolling
# to the end, image request img_b.bmp), d.html via the last link, then c.html and each of its 14 links in turn (each visit ends with B and A, which
# leaves an error dialog or a page): a local page, a missing page (served with the generic page), ../di/*.htm and file://di/*.htm help links (the
# ROM asks the server: HTTP 404 -> error 32-404), an absolute URL, direct .bmp URLs (tall image, oversized 160x120 image), big.html (4.8 KB:
# "ホームページがおおきすぎて すべてひょうじ できませんでした"), fragment, mailto:, another host name (fake DNS). Starts from the state left by
# 'browser_bookmarks'. Fake Internet latency 2 frames. Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # title -> top menu (the first A is swallowed by the logo)
waitstable 60 max 600
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap A                        # ホームページ
waitstable 60 max 900
shot pagelist_tutorial_1
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
shot prompt
tap A                        # ホームページ
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A                        # password screen
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 1200
shot index
# --- a.html
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
wait 1500
shot a_top
tap DOWN x12
wait 40
tap DOWN x12
wait 40
tap DOWN x12
wait 40
shot a_bottom
tap LEFT
wait 40
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap B
wait 900
shot back_to_index
# --- b.html (scroll to the end)
